#### __2. Frontend Latency Tracking__

```javascript
// React Frontend - End-to-End Measurement
class LatencyMonitor {
  measureDataFlow() {
    const timestamps = {
      data_received: Date.now(),
      chart_updated: null,
      strategy_processed: null,
      ui_rendered: null
    };
    
    // Track each step in the pipeline
    return {
      data_to_chart: timestamps.chart_updated - timestamps.data_received,
      chart_to_strategy: timestamps.strategy_processed - timestamps.chart_updated,
      strategy_to_ui: timestamps.ui_rendered - timestamps.strategy_processed,
      total_frontend: timestamps.ui_rendered - timestamps.data_received
    };
  }
}
```

